              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "क्रमशः — kramśaḥ — \"little by little; by degrees\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नदी का पानी क्रमशः ऊपर आ रहा था। nadī kā pānī kramśaḥ ūpar ā rahā thā. The river water was rising little by little."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal and written; speech says धीरे-धीरे."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "क्रमशः (kramśaḥ) is Sanskrit kramaśas, \"step by step, by degrees\" (Monier-Williams), from krama, a step. It ends in the sign ः. At the end of a newspaper story printed in parts it means \"to be continued\"."
            }
          ]
        },
